~ start

Nyan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], nice to meet you.
Nyan: Welcome to your new farm.
Nyan: As you can see, the cows and chickens are hungry.
Nyan: We need to grow some crops before we can feed them again.
Nyan: But first, you'll need some Corn Seeds.
Nyan: The Seed Shop nearby still has some in stock.

- Take 125 Gold
    Teemo: Thank you! I'll buy some Corn Seeds.
    do PlayerProgressManager.add_gold(125)
    do QuestManager.start_quest("buy_corn_seeds")

- Maybe later
    Teemo: I'll come back when I'm ready.

=> END
~ progress

Nyan: The Seed Shop is nearby.
Nyan: Buy 5 Corn Seeds and come back to me.

=> END


~ turn_in

Nyan: Excellent!
Nyan: You bought everything you need.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Nyan: Now I'll teach you the basics of farming.

do GameDialogueManager.action_teach_farming()

do QuestManager.start_quest("first_harvest")

Nyan: Your first task is simple.
Nyan: Harvest 5 Corn and bring them to me.

=> END


~ completed

Nyan: Good work, farmer.

=> END